			<Comment>♂
・首振りアニメ
・続けて</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-15T06:26:30" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>BOSS
Ｎ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
